# Feature Work Items

Create:

```text
active/<FEATURE-ID>-<short-name>/FEATURE_PACKET.md
```

Copy `docs/templates/FEATURE_PACKET.md`.

Allowed status:

```text
draft
design-ready
code-ready
in-progress
verification
accepted
blocked
cancelled
```

A `code-ready` packet records readiness; implementation still follows the user-authorized scope. Explicitly scoped maintenance does not require a new packet. Archive after verified acceptance.


A learning prototype may have its own scoped packet before production code-ready. Record its question, authorized boundaries, mocks, evidence and conditions for reuse. Completing that experiment does not pass the production feature gate.
